==Description== <!--T:2-->

<!--T:3-->
This macro retrieves the global placement of selected objects in the 3D view, taking into account links, link arrays, and link scales. The result is displayed in the Report View. This is useful when working with complex assemblies where objects are nested inside multiple links and you need to determine their absolute position in world coordinates.

==Usage== <!--T:4-->

<!--T:5-->
# Select one or more objects or sub-elements in the 3D view
# Run the macro
# The global placement information will be displayed in the Report View ({{MenuCommand|View → Panels → Report view}})
# The output includes the X, Y, Z position and rotation for each selected object

